  ('cogs_delivered', 1, 'COGS on delivered units', 'economics', 'EGP', 'measured', 'Σ unit_cogs_snapshot × quantity on lines of delivered orders', NULL, NULL, '["week","drop","offer","location","product","variant","size","category"]', 'lower_better', 'drop_day', 'Cancelled units are not charged COGS where the stock is restocked — charging it double-counts. Where stock is not recovered it is charged. Units with no COGS snapshot are left out and reported through cogs_coverage_rate (partial state).', '["fact_order","fact_order_line","dim_variant"]', '1970-01-01', NULL, 'v1: Growth OS L0 seed (GROWTH-OS-SESSION-1-SPEC.md).', '2026-09-12T00:00:00Z'),
